# Hands-free voice (R-047, D-52): the wake word starts a turn without a key, the
# end of speech ends it; speaking while the answer plays stops it at once and
# starts the next turn (barge-in). Hands-free profile (voice front end modelled).
@3s      mic   silence
+1s      mic   wake              # the wake word ...
+700ms   mic   speech            # ... then the question
+1500ms  mic   silence           # done: the turn ends after the voice activity hangover
+5s      snap  first-answer
+0       mic   speech            # talking over the answer interrupts it
+1500ms  mic   silence
+9s      snap  second-answer
+20s     end
